.TH strarray_sort 3
.SH NAME
strarray_sort \- sort elements of a string array
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "strarray.h"
.PP
.BI "void strarray_sort(strarray *" arr ", int (*" compare ")(const char**, const char**));"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B strarray_sort
sorts the elements of the string array
.I arr
in-place. If
.I compare
is NULL, it performs a lexicographical sort using
.BR str_diff (3).
Otherwise, it uses the provided comparison function.